{"ID":"20240205153845-kfgjawm","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153845-kfgjawm","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153845-kfgjawm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206112241-gyemv7e\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240628142457-dp9sqyj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3274,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240628142457-dp9sqyj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:12,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:12\u0026#125;","title":"金银花","type":"doc","updated":"20240902175605"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206112241-gyemv7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112241-gyemv7e","updated":"20240206112252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、山东等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈棒状，上粗下细，略弯曲，长2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm，上部直径3mm，下部直径1.5mm，表面黄白色或绿白色，密被短柔毛。偶见叶状苞片，花萼绿色、先端5裂，裂片有毛，长约2mm，开放者花冠筒状，先端二唇形，雄蕊5附于筒壁，黄色；雌蕊1个，子房无毛，气清香，味淡微苦。\n【性味】\t甘，寒。\n【功效】\t宣散风热，清热解毒。用于各种热性病，如身热、发疹、发斑、热毒疮痈、咽喉肿痛等证。"}]},{"ID":"20240206112241-tj9qlw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206112241-tj9qlw4","updated":"20240206112241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206112241-dbd0y95.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717180505-ffswrpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717180505-ffswrpw","updated":"20240717180505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"金银